$$

. . .

Like any other number, $e$ follows normal power properties:

$$
\begin{align}
e^x\cdot e^y &=& ?\\
\frac{1}{e^x} &=& ?\\
\frac{e^x}{e^y} &=& ?\\
(e^x)^r &=& ?
\end{align}
